  ⚠ the top-level `[tool.pixi.exclude-newer]` table of per-package cutoffs is deprecated in favor of the `exemptions` of `[tool.pixi.workspace.exclude-newer]`
    ╭─[pixi.toml:10:1]
  9 │
 10 │ ╭─▶ [tool.pixi.exclude-newer]
 11 │ ├─▶ polars = "0d"
    · ╰──── replace this with `[tool.pixi.workspace.exclude-newer.exemptions]`
 12 │
    ╰────
  help: move the entries to the `exemptions` of `[tool.pixi.workspace.exclude-newer]` instead, e.g. replace the current `exclude-newer` of `[tool.pixi.workspace]` with

        [tool.pixi.workspace.exclude-newer]
        cutoff = "7days"
        exemptions = { polars = "*" }

        An exemption allows the matching releases regardless of their upload time. Narrow `"*"` down to the releases you vetted, e.g. `"1.2.3"`.

  ⚠ the top-level `[tool.pixi.pypi-exclude-newer]` table of per-package cutoffs is deprecated in favor of the `exemptions` of `[tool.pixi.workspace.pypi-exclude-newer]`
    ╭─[pixi.toml:13:1]
 12 │
 13 │ ╭─▶ [tool.pixi.pypi-exclude-newer]
 14 │ ├─▶ boltons = "0d"
    · ╰──── replace this with `[tool.pixi.workspace.pypi-exclude-newer.exemptions]`
    ╰────
  help: move the entries to the `exemptions` of `[tool.pixi.workspace.pypi-exclude-newer]` instead, e.g. replace the current `pypi-exclude-newer` of `[tool.pixi.workspace]` with

        [tool.pixi.workspace.pypi-exclude-newer]
        exemptions = { boltons = "*" }

        An exemption allows every release of the package regardless of its upload time.
